        "original_id": "5fbce7b4-7589-5170-9c38-e53c8d5da391",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Frank Sindone, Angelo Bruno\n- Organizations: Bruno crime family\n- Roles: loan shark, soldier, mob boss\n- Events: 1980 murder of Angelo Bruno\n- Concepts: nicknames, leadership style\n\nFacts:\n- Frank Sindone was born in 1928 and died on October 29, 1980.\n- Frank Sindone, also known as \"Barracuda Frank,\" was a loan shark and a soldier in the Bruno crime family.\n- In 1980, Frank Sindone helped plot the murder of Bruno crime family boss Angelo Bruno.\n- Angelo Bruno was known as \"the Gentle Don\" and \"the Docile Don.\"\n- Angelo Bruno gained those nicknames and that reputation because he preferred conciliation over violence.\n- Angelo Bruno's leadership style contrasted with that of his more violent successors.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
